WEBVTT

00:20:57.996 --> 00:21:00.916
And can the other person
express themselves?

00:21:00.956 --> 00:21:03.076
Because I think that's where --

00:21:03.116 --> 00:21:05.756
what we really want is to feel known

00:21:05.796 --> 00:21:07.796
and to feel seen

00:21:07.796 --> 00:21:14.276
and not to feel like we are having
to maintain a façade

00:21:14.316 --> 00:21:16.316
that hides who we are.

00:21:16.356 --> 00:21:21.116
And so the best relationships are those
where we feel we can be ourselves.

00:21:22.356 --> 00:21:27.356
WPR: And you talked about how, really,
it's romantic relationships, friendships,

00:21:27.396 --> 00:21:28.556
acquaintances,

00:21:28.556 --> 00:21:30.556
I mean, all of these relationships matter.